  "term": "TUI",
  "definition": "TUI, or Tui Na, is a Chinese massage method that uses movements such as kneading, pressing, rolling, shaking, and stretching of the body. It is described as aiming to regulate qi and blood flow and to support the function of tendons, bones, and joints.",
